Fresh Fast Website Security Plugin checks and adds additional security to the WordPress.

== Description ==

Fresh Fast Website Security Plugin helps you to set your WordPress site more secure.
Is WordPress hardening difficult to you? You do not need any developer skills, you can set it easily through the administration.
And your WordPress security can be maintained from there. You can select which options you want to use.

What is in the basic mode? You can:

- Change default admin user - change his Login, Nickname, Nicename
- Check if your administration and login pages are running on secure HTTPS protocol.
- Remove WoordPress version from displaying on website
- Disable password reset
- Disable unused Feed exports
- Disable Wordpress news and blog widgets on admin dashboard


== Installation ==

1. Install plugin in your WordPress Plugin options with "Add New" button (or you can extract the downloaded zip file into your plugins directory into its own folder)
2. Activate the plugin in the Plugin options.
3. Customize the settings from the Options panel.

